{"id":"5db086b596a0f700","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-orthdnf.md","title":"Orthogonal DNF","display":"df-orthdnf — Orthogonal DNF","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-orthdnf","aliases":["27-df-orthdnf"],"display":"df-orthdnf — Orthogonal DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-orthterm]]"],"local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-orthdnf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-orthdnf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-orthdnf — Orthogonal DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0592a2b3124532a9\" href=\"?note=0592a2b3124532a9\" title=\"27-df-orthterm\">27-df-orthterm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a> 的有限项集族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthTerm}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrthTerm}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0592a2b3124532a9\" href=\"?note=0592a2b3124532a9\" title=\"27-df-orthterm\">27-df-orthterm</a> 的二元项谓词。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\)</span> 是本节引入的 DNF 子族定义目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\forall T,U\\in D\\,(T\\neq U\\to\\mathrm{OrthTerm}(T,U))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\forall T,U\\in D\\,(T\\neq U\\to\\mathrm{OrthTerm}(T,U))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §7.1，印刷页 327，PDF 第 351 页（从 1 计数）。逐对不同项具有冲突文字，等价于任意两个项不能同时取 1。空 DNF 和单项 DNF 均满足定义；空项只能单独出现在正交 DNF 中。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|T(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))|=\\sum_{U\\in D}|T(U)|\">\\(|T(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))|=\\sum_{U\\in D}|T(U)|\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-orthterm","status":"resolved","id":"0592a2b3124532a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-orthterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ 为 [[27-df-dnf]] 的有限项集族，$\\mathrm{OrthTerm}$ 为 [[27-df-orthterm]] 的二元项谓词。$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 是本节引入的 DNF 子族定义目标。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-orthterm","status":"resolved","id":"0592a2b3124532a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ 为 [[27-df-dnf]] 的有限项集族，$\\mathrm{OrthTerm}$ 为 [[27-df-orthterm]] 的二元项谓词。$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 是本节引入的 DNF 子族定义目标。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthTerm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n\\coloneqq\\{D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\mid\\forall T,U\\in D\\,(T\\neq U\\to\\mathrm{OrthTerm}(T,U))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"|T(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D))|=\\sum_{U\\in D}|T(U)|","display":false}],"bytes":1089,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c3b82c1fc896440","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D,E\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]。$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 是本节引入的 $\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ 上的二元关系定义目标。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-orthdnf|df-orthdnf — Orthogonal DNF]]"},{"id":"c0df060e8c8d5801","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]，$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，真点集 $T(f)=\\{a\\in\\mathbb B^n:f(a)=1\\}$ 见 [[27-df-truefalse]]。$\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)$ 取上述 DNF 上游 [[27-df-litset]] 的文字集函数。"},{"id":"960197535160cece","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{DNF}_n,\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{OrthogonalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthdnf]]，$\\mathrm{Orthogonalization}_n$ 见 [[27-df-orthogonalize]]。"}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","0592a2b3124532a9"]}